```suggestion
    users.users.tailscaled = {
      isSystemUser = true;
      group = "tailscaled";
      extraGroups = lib.mkIf (config.security.tpm2.enable) [ config.security.tpm2.tssGroup ];
    };
    users.groups.tailscaled = { };
```

This shouldn't need to create that group, as it is already covered by the [security.tpm2.tssGroup](https://search.nixos.org/options?channel=unstable&include_modular_service_options=1&include_nixos_options=1&query=security.tpm2.&show=option:security.tpm2.tssGroup) option.

